      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To initiate the computer repair process, begin by examining the hardware."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the implicit process start, the explicit instruction to start/initiate the repair process, and the first operational step of examining hardware."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "proceed with repairing any issues that were identified."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly implements the repair step for previously identified hardware issues."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After the necessary repairs have been made, conclude the hardware inspection."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully reproduces the conclusion of the initial inspection phase following the first round of repairs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Following the completion of the repair process, it is important to test the functionality of the system."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly matches the requirement to test system functionality after repairs."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the test results indicate that everything is functioning properly"
